      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Create App in Launchpad: right-click any program in a bottle to get its own app with the program&#x27;s icon — in Launchpad, Spotlight and the Dock</li><li>New built-in Wine engine: Wine 10 (latest Sikarugir build) with DXMT 0.80 — DirectX 10–11 via Metal, now for 32-bit games too</li><li>D3DMetal for DirectX 12 games now comes from Apple directly: download the free Game Porting Toolkit and PortWin connects it in one click (Settings, a bottle&#x27;s Graphics, or System Check). If you already use D3DMetal, nothing changes</li></ul>]]></description>
